### Docker-specific ignores ###
# Ignore Docker Compose files (if you have custom overrides)
docker-compose.override.yml

# Ignore Docker build context directories
**/docker-compose/data/
**/docker-compose/logs/

# Ignore Docker volume directories
**/volumes/

# Ignore Docker-specific files
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile.local
**/docker-compose.env

# Ignore Docker Compose build artifacts
**/docker-compose.build.*

